# Local-only telemetry log (see .harness/agents/orchestrator.md "## Telemetry").
# Jira mirror PAT file (mirror.board.pat_file default) — never commit a PAT.
# Per-run agent output under progress/ is ephemeral scratch; the inbox briefs and
# the loose files directly under progress/ stay tracked (order matters — the
# re-inclusions must follow progress/*/).
telemetry.jsonl
workers.json
jira.pat
state/tasks.json.lock
.pr-loop/
.opencode-parallel
__pycache__/
*.pyc
progress/*/
!progress/.gitkeep
!progress/README.md
!progress/inbox/
!progress/inbox/**
